---
source: tests/snapshots.rs
expression: help_for(&args)
---
CLI for the Flute payments platform

Usage: flute2 [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  auth              Authentication and profile management
  ping              API health check
  version           Print CLI version and active profile
  transactions      Transaction operations (create, capture, reversal, …)
  customers         Customer operations (create, get, list, update, delete)
  payment-methods   Payment-method vault operations (list, get, add-card, add-ach, update, delete, set-default)
  payment-links     Payment link operations (create, get, list, update, delete, share)
  payment-sessions  Payment session operations (create, get, cancel)
  terminals         Terminal operations (list, status)
  pos               POS transaction operations (create [--wait], get, list, cancel, print-receipt)
  settlements       Settlement batch operations (list, get, close)
  settings          Account settings operations (payment-config, contact-info, autofill, update-autofill)
  api-keys          Merchant API key operations (create, list, revoke)
  completion        Print shell completion script for the given shell
  update            Update the flute2 CLI to the latest release
  help              Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version

Global options:
      --profile <PROFILE>  Active profile (environment). `sandbox` (default) or `production`/`prod` [env: FLUTE2_PROFILE=]
      --output <OUTPUT>    Output format: table (default), json, or quiet (id only). When omitted, falls back to the `FLUTE2_OUTPUT` env var, then to the `output` key in ~/.flute2/config.toml, then to `table` [env: FLUTE2_OUTPUT=] [possible values: table, json, quiet]
      --debug              Print HTTP request/response traces to stderr. Card and bank-account numbers are masked to the last 4 digits; CVV/security codes are removed
